咱们取地面的这种棕色。

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:46.110
And if we're touching brown, let's go ahead and stop everything.
如果我们碰到棕色，那就直接停止所有动作。

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:49.130
The ball is going to stop moving.
球会停止移动。

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:50.990
So now I press the flag.
现在我点击绿旗。

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:51.950
The ball falls.
球开始下落。

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.690
And now as soon as it touches the ground,
现在只要它碰到地面，

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:57.500
as soon as it just reaches the beginning of that brown section,
只要它刚到达那个棕色区域的边缘，

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:59.210
the ball is going to stop moving.
球就会停止移动。

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:02.060
And if I wanted to go again, I press the green flag.
如果我想再试一次，我就点击绿旗。

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:07.395
And you notice the ball fall until it hits the ground, and then it stops.
你会注意到球一直下落到碰到地面，然后就停了。

00:17:07.395 --> 00:17:09.520
And as we're watching this, I can drag the ball out
我们看着的时候，我可以把球拖出来，

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:11.510
and let it fall over and over again.
让它反复下落。

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:14.319
You might notice that it doesn't look very realistic.
你可能会注意到这看起来不太真实。

00:17:14.319 --> 00:17:16.730
And why isn't this falling very realistic?
为什么它下落得不太真实呢？

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:18.650
Well, I have a ball here with me now.
嗯，我现在手里有个球。

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:21.310
And what happens if I toss the ball, and let it fall?
如果我把球抛出去再让它落下，会发生什么呢？

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.140
How quickly does it fall?
它下落得有多快呢？

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:26.920
Well, you'll notice as I let that ball fall, that it actually
嗯，你会注意到我让球落下时，实际上它

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:28.420
starts a little more slowly.
一开始速度慢一些。

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:30.250
At the top, it's more slow.
在顶部时，速度更慢。

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:33.370
And then as it falls, over time, it gets faster and faster.
然后随着下落，它会越来越快。

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:36.160
And it falls faster as it gets closer to the ground.
越接近地面，下落速度越快。

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:38.650
It's slow, and then it gets faster.
先慢，然后变快。

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:41.950
And right now, that's not what my ball here is doing.
而现在，我这里的球不是这样的。

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:46.300
Right now, my ball is just moving by five units every time
现在，每次我们执行一次这个循环，我的球只移动五个单位。

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:50.300
we run through an iteration of this loop.
所以如果我真的想让球的移动更真实，

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:54.430
And so if I really wanted for the ball to be moving realistically,
它一开始应该移动得慢些，然后

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:57.460
it should be moving slower at first, and then
越接近地面就变得越快。

00:17:57.460 --> 00:18:01.660
get faster as it gets closer to the ground.
当它越接近地面时速度越快。

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.110
So how could we achieve that?
那么我们要如何实现这一点呢？

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:06.250
Well, rather than move by five steps every time,
嗯，与其每次都移动五格，

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:09.220
we could move by a variable number of steps every time.
我们可以每次移动不同数量的格数。

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:13.720
A variable that's keeping track of how many steps should we be moving.
用一个变量来记录我们应该移动多少格。

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:16.450
And then we can update that variable so that the ball moves
然后我们可以更新这个变量，这样球在

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:20.560
faster as it gets closer to the ground.
接近地面时就会移动得更快。

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:21.950
So how do we achieve that?
那么我们要如何实现这一点呢？

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:25.070
Well, the first thing we need is we need a new variable.
嗯，我们首先需要创建一个新变量。

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:28.870
So I'm going to go into variables here, and create a new variable.
所以我要到这里的变量板块，创建一个新变量。

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.300
And I'll just call the variable, speed.
我就把这个变量命名为“速度”。

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:33.640
And now I have a decision to make as I usually do.
现在和往常一样，我要做一个决定。

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:35.440
Is this for all sprites?
这个变量是供所有角色使用吗？

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.390
Or for this sprite only?
还是仅供这个角色使用？

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:40.570
And for this variable, I'm actually going to make it for this sprite only.
对于这个变量，我实际上打算让它仅供这个角色使用。

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:42.580
This speed is only going to be a variable
这个“速度”只会是一个

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:46.150
that this ball is going to get to use, because no other sprite needs
供这个球使用的变量，因为没有其他角色需要

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:49.060
to use or access the speed of the ball.
使用或访问这个球的速度。

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:51.400
And that's going to be helpful because maybe later I
这会很有用，因为也许之后我

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:54.350
might want to have a second ball that's bouncing up and down too.
可能还想有第二个球也在上下弹跳。

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:56.953
And then each ball should have its own speed.
那么每个球都应该有自己的速度。

00:18:56.953 --> 00:18:58.870
I don't want them to be sharing the same speed
我不希望它们共享相同的速度，

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:03.500
because one ball might be moving more slowly or more quickly than the other.
因为一个球可能比另一个球移动得更慢或更快。

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:06.250
So this variable is going to be a local variable.
所以这个变量将是一个局部变量。

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:10.793
Only this ball is going to get to modify this speed variable.
只有这个球可以修改这个“速度”变量。

00:19:10.793 --> 00:19:13.210
And you'll notice that now, in this reporting block that's
你会注意到，现在在这个显示数值的积木里，它

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.640
telling me what the speed of the ball is, it's telling me
告诉我球的速度是多少，它显示的是

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:19.600
it's the speed variable that is associated with the ball sprite.
与球这个角色关联的“速度”变量。

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:24.410
It's telling me what sprite the variable belongs to.
它会告诉我这个变量属于哪个角色。

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:27.300
And so now, what do I do here?
那么现在，我在这里要做什么呢？

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:30.350
Well, initially, when I press the green flag for the first time,
嗯，最初，当我第一次按下绿旗时，

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:33.670
let's set the speed to 0.
我们把速度设为0。

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:41.110
Then instead of changing y by negative 5, let's change y by the speed.
然后，不要把y坐标减去5，而是把y坐标加上“速度”的值。

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:43.175
Changing it by a variable amount.
以一个可变的量来改变它。

00:19:43.175 --> 00:19:44.800
And then what do I want to have happen?
然后我希望接下来发生什么呢？

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:48.430
Every time the loop goes through, every time time passes,
每次循环执行，每过一段时间，

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:53.410
I want to move faster down the stage, which means
我希望球在舞台上向下移动得更快，这意味着

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:55.480
I want this value to be more negative.
我希望这个值变得更负。

00:19:55.480 --> 00:20:01.140
So I'm going to change the speed by negative 1.
所以我要把“速度”减去1。

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.160
What does that mean?
这意味着什么呢？

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.670
That means the speed is going to start at 0.
这意味着速度将从0开始。

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:07.760
And the first time we run through the loop, we're going to change y by 0.
我们第一次执行循环时，要把 y 值改变 0。

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.325
We're not changing it at all.
也就是完全不改变它。

00:20:09.325 --> 00:20:11.450
Then we're going to change the speed by negative 1.
然后我们要把速度改变 -1。

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:13.190
Now the speed is negative 1.
现在速度变成 -1 了。

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:15.245
We're going to change y by negative 1.
我们要把 y 值改变 -1。

00:20:15.245 --> 00:20:17.120
Then we change the speed by negative 1 again.
接着我们再把速度改变 -1。

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:18.650
Now it's negative 2.
现在速度是 -2 了。

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.920
And the next time the loop runs we change y by negative 2,
下一次循环执行时，我们把 y 值改变 -2，

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:22.850
and then negative 3.
再下一次改变 -3。

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:25.125
And every time we run through the loop, the ball
每次执行循环时，球

00:20:25.125 --> 00:20:27.500
is going to be moving more, and more, and more each time.
每次都会移动得越来越多。

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:34.290
Effectively, moving faster as time goes on until it's touching the ground.
实际上，随着时间推移，它会移动得越来越快，直到碰到地面。

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:40.460
And so let's give that a try now, and see what happens.
现在我们来试试看，看看会发生什么。

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.730
Bring the ball up.
把球往上移。

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:43.300
And it falls.
然后它就掉下来了。

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:45.670
And you'll notice that it does exactly what I want.
你会注意到它完全符合我的预期。

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:49.722
At the very beginning, it's falling fairly slowly.
刚开始的时候，它下落得相当慢。

00:20:49.722 --> 00:20:51.180
But then it speeds up near the end.
但到快结束时就加速了。

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:54.300
You notice near the end the ball speed is all the way up to negative 24,
你会注意到快结束时，球的速度达到了 -24，

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:55.140
for example.
举个例子。

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:58.800
It's getting faster and faster.
它变得越来越快。

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.470
And so that's working pretty well.
所以效果还不错。

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:04.430
It's more realistic now because at the very beginning,
现在更逼真了，因为在刚开始的时候，

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:05.810
the ball is moving slowly.
球移动得很慢。

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:08.010
And then over time it's getting faster and faster.
然后随着时间推移，它变得越来越快。

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:10.760
Of course, the thing that it's not doing that a real ball would do
当然，它和真正的球不同的地方在于

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:12.110
is it's not bouncing.
它不会反弹。

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:14.270
Normally, when I bounce a ball, it hits the ground
通常情况下，我拍球时，球碰到地面

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:16.070
and then it bounces back up to me.
然后会反弹回我这里。

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:17.270
So how could I do that?
那么我要怎么做才能实现这个效果呢？

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:19.070
What do I need to change?
我需要改变什么呢？

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:23.190
Well, this variable speed, that's controlling
嗯，这个变量“速度”，它控制着

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:28.420
how many steps the ball is moving every time I run through this loop.
每次执行这个循环时球移动的步数。

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:32.760
And so when the speed is negative, that means the y value is going to decrease.
所以当速度为负时，意味着 y 值会减小。

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:36.270
Meaning we're going to be moving down on the stage.
也就是球会在舞台上向下移动。

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:39.900
If I instead wanted the ball to start moving up once it reached the bottom,
如果我想让球到达底部后开始向上移动，

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:43.890
then I want the speed to not be negative, but to instead be positive.
那么我希望速度不是负的，而是正的。

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:47.980
And how do I change the speed from a negative number into a positive number?
那我要怎么把速度从负数变成正数呢？

00:21:47.980 --> 00:21:51.000
Well, I can multiply the speed by negative 1.
嗯，我可以把速度乘以 -1。

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:54.270
Then the speed will go from being negative moving down quickly to being
这样速度就会从快速向下的负数变成

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:57.180
a positive number moving up quickly.
一个正数，让角色快速向上移动。

00:21:57.180 --> 00:22:01.020
And so let's give that a try now as well.
那么现在我们也来试试看。

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:05.310
Once I'm touching the ground, rather than stopping everything,
一旦角色碰到地面，与其让一切都停下来，

00:22:05.310 --> 00:22:07.330
let's do something else.
我们做点别的事。

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:12.040
Let's set the speed to a particular value.
我们把速度设为一个特定的值。

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:15.640
And I want it to be the speed multiplied by negative 1.
我想让它是当前速度乘以 -1。

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:16.750
So going to operations.
所以我们到运算积木这里。

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:18.510
We'll do multiply.
我们用乘法。

00:22:18.510 --> 00:22:24.350
And we'll calculate what a speed times negative 1.
我们来计算速度乘以 -1 的结果。

00:22:24.350 --> 00:22:28.970
And let's set the speed to that.
然后把速度设为这个结果。

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:34.365
So now every time we change the speed we check are we touching the ground.
所以现在每次改变速度时，我们都会检查是否碰到地面。

00:22:34.365 --> 00:22:36.990
And if we are touching the ground, the speed's going to invert.
如果碰到地面，速度就会反转。

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:41.135
Moving the opposite direction and start moving up now instead.
朝相反方向移动，现在开始向上移动。

00:22:41.135 --> 00:22:44.650
So if I drag the ball up and let it go, watch what happens.
所以如果我把球往上拖然后松开，看看会发生什么。

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:47.490
It falls and then it bounces.
它落下然后反弹。

00:22:47.490 --> 00:22:48.750
And it bounces.
它会一直反弹。

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:51.900
And it keeps bouncing.
它持续反弹。

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:54.990
And the reason that's happening is because it's getting negative speed
之所以会这样，是因为它下落时速度为负。

00:22:54.990 --> 00:22:56.280
as it's going down.
当它向下运动时。

00:22:56.280 --> 00:22:59.410
And then as soon as it touches the ground, the speed becomes positive.
一旦它碰到地面，速度就变为正。

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:02.040
And then it goes back up again.
然后它又会向上运动。

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:04.160
Now the one thing this isn't doing if we really
现在，如果我们真的

00:23:04.160 --> 00:23:06.035
wanted to make this even more realistic, just
想让这个效果更逼真，只是

00:23:06.035 --> 00:23:08.210
to add one final touch to this program, is
给这个程序再添最后一笔，就是

00:23:08.210 --> 00:23:11.250
that when I throw the ball on the ground,
当我把球扔到地上时，

00:23:11.250 --> 00:23:13.040
it doesn't come up to the same place.
它不会弹回到原来的高度。

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:14.720
It's a little bit lower every time.
每次反弹的高度都会低一点。

00:23:14.720 --> 00:23:16.797
Every time the ball bounces it starts high.
每次球反弹时，起始高度都很高。

00:23:16.797 --> 00:23:19.380
Then it might be a little lower then a little lower than that.
然后可能会低一点，再之后会更低一点。

00:23:19.380 --> 00:23:22.847
It loses a little bit of speed every time I bounce the ball.
每次球反弹都会损失一点速度。

00:23:22.847 --> 00:23:24.680
But this is the great thing about variables.
但这就是变量的妙处。

00:23:24.680 --> 00:23:27.320
I can set this variable to be whatever I want.
我可以把这个变量设成我想要的任何值。

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:30.060
And I can use these operators-- adding, and subtracting,
我可以用这些运算符——加、减，

00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:34.070
and multiplying, and dividing to figure out exactly what I want for a variable
乘、除来精确算出我想要变量

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:34.740
to be.
变成的值。

00:23:34.740 --> 00:23:38.850
So maybe I want the speed to decrease by a little every time.
所以也许我想让速度每次都稍微降低一点。

00:23:38.850 --> 00:23:43.790
Don't just make the speed positive, but subtract 1 or subtract 2 from the speed
不要只是让速度变为正，而是从速度里减去 1 或者减去 2

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:48.980
so that now it's moving a little more slowly every time the ball bounces.
这样每次球反弹时移动速度就会慢一点。

00:23:48.980 --> 00:23:51.800
So I can go back into operators, and let's
所以我可以回到运算积木这里，然后我们

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:57.740
subtract 2 from whatever that new speed was supposed to be.
从新速度里减去 2。

00:23:57.740 --> 00:23:58.790
We invert the speed.
我们把速度取反。

00:23:58.790 --> 00:23:59.930
We subtract 2.
我们减去2。

00:23:59.930 --> 00:24:04.670
And now it's going to go from a higher bounce to a lower bounce.
现在它会从高弹变成低弹。

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:08.210
And every time you'll notice that it decreases a little until it
每次你都会注意到它的弹起高度会降低一点，直到

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:10.750
kind of gets stuck at the bottom there.
有点像是卡在了下面。

00:24:10.750 --> 00:24:11.750
But we can try it again.
但我们可以再试一次。

00:24:15.130 --> 00:24:17.635
It's going lower and lower each time.
它每次弹得越来越低。

00:24:17.635 --> 00:24:19.510
And eventually, it's going to hit the bottom.
最终，它会停在底部。

00:24:19.510 --> 00:24:21.820
And you might have to play around with it a little bit.
你可能得稍微调整一下。

00:24:21.820 --> 00:24:23.710
Once it gets to a speed that's low enough,
一旦它的速度足够低，

00:24:23.710 --> 00:24:25.720
the ball should eventually just stop moving.
球最终应该会停止移动。

00:24:25.720 --> 00:24:29.770
But this is approximating that idea-- of a ball that's bouncing again and again.
但这是在近似模拟一个球不断弹跳的情况。

00:24:29.770 --> 00:24:32.410
And we're able to use variables to control the speed
我们能够使用变量来控制速度

00:24:32.410 --> 00:24:36.990
to make this much more realistic.
让这个效果更加真实。

00:24:36.990 --> 00:24:37.490
All right.
好的。

00:24:37.490 --> 00:24:38.948
What else can we do with variables?
我们还能用变量做什么呢？

00:24:38.948 --> 00:24:41.610
We'll take a look at a couple other final examples.
我们来看几个其他的最终示例。

00:24:41.610 --> 00:24:45.740
One is we can let the user have control over the variable itself.
其一，我们可以让用户来控制变量本身。

00:24:45.740 --> 00:24:46.700
What you'll notice--
你会注意到——

00:24:46.700 --> 00:24:49.220
I'll go ahead and get rid of the ball, and go back
我先把球去掉，然后回到

00:24:49.220 --> 00:24:51.860
to the plain white backdrop.
纯白色的背景。

00:24:51.860 --> 00:24:55.040
Let's go back to the balloon example that we've seen a couple of times
我们回到之前看过几次的气球示例。

00:24:55.040 --> 00:24:56.840
now where the balloon was inflating.
就是那个气球在充气的例子。

00:24:56.840 --> 00:24:59.600
And it was inflating either when we blew at the microphone,
它会在我们对着麦克风吹气时充气，

00:24:59.600 --> 00:25:04.410
or press the spacebar, or we just let it go automatically via a loop.
或者按下空格键，又或者通过循环让它自动充气。

00:25:04.410 --> 00:25:08.840
Let's let the user now control how big or small the balloon should be.
现在让用户来控制气球的大小。

00:25:08.840 --> 00:25:13.170
Let the user control how much air is inside of the balloon.
让用户控制气球里有多少空气。

00:25:13.170 --> 00:25:17.240
Let's create a variable that I'm just going to call, air.
我们创建一个变量，我就叫它“空气”。

00:25:17.240 --> 00:25:20.510
And now what is this air variable going to do?
那么这个“空气”变量要怎么用呢？

00:25:20.510 --> 00:25:25.010
Well, if I Control click on this area here where
嗯，如果我按住Control键点击这里的区域，在这个区域

00:25:25.010 --> 00:25:27.410
I can see what the value of a variable is,
我可以看到变量的值，

00:25:27.410 --> 00:25:30.170
I can change what the readout looks like.
我可以改变显示样式。

00:25:30.170 --> 00:25:31.520
This is a normal readout.
这是普通的显示样式。

00:25:31.520 --> 00:25:34.100
If I change it to a large readout, you just
如果我把它改成大字体显示，你就会

00:25:34.100 --> 00:25:36.110
see the number a little bit bigger.
看到数字大一点。

00:25:36.110 --> 00:25:38.420
But I can also change it to a slider.
但我也可以把它改成滑块样式。

00:25:38.420 --> 00:25:41.510
And when it's a slider, the user of the program
当它是滑块样式时，程序的用户

00:25:41.510 --> 00:25:45.350
can just move the slider to control what the value of the variable
就可以移动滑块来控制变量的值

00:25:45.350 --> 00:25:46.310
is going to be.
是多少。

00:25:46.310 --> 00:25:50.580
I can change air to be 0 all the way up to 100 for example.
比如，我可以把“空气”的值从0调整到100。

00:25:50.580 --> 00:25:55.310
And that lets the user have some control over the variables in the program.
这就让用户能够对程序中的变量进行一定的控制。

00:25:55.310 --> 00:25:57.440
And how big was this balloon before?
这个气球之前有多大呢？

00:25:57.440 --> 00:26:01.790
Well, usually, it was somewhere between like size 100 and 200.
嗯，通常它的大小在100到200之间。

00:26:01.790 --> 00:26:04.550
So let me edit the slider range.
那我来编辑一下滑块的范围。

00:26:04.550 --> 00:26:06.590
Set the minimum value to 100.
把最小值设为100。

00:26:06.590 --> 00:26:08.310
And the maximum value to 200.
最大值设为200。

00:26:08.310 --> 00:26:11.210
I did that by Control clicking on the slider.
我是通过按住Control键点击滑块来完成的。

00:26:11.210 --> 00:26:15.050
And then changing the slider range to now range between 100
然后把滑块范围改成现在从最小值100

00:26:15.050 --> 00:26:18.560
at a minimum and 200 at a maximum.
到最大值200。

00:26:18.560 --> 00:26:21.570
So I can go back and forth between those two values.
这样我就能在这两个值之间来回调整了。

00:26:21.570 --> 00:26:24.140
And now what do I want the balloon to do?
现在我希望气球做什么呢？

00:26:24.140 --> 00:26:27.590
Well, when the flag is clicked, we'll just
嗯，当点击旗帜时，我们就

00:26:27.590 --> 00:26:36.290
add a few blocks that say forever I want the balloon to set it size not to 100%,
添加几个积木，让气球永远将自身大小设置为，不是100%，

00:26:36.290 --> 00:26:38.720
but to air percent.
而是空气百分比。

00:26:38.720 --> 00:26:42.980
Whatever the value of the air variable is.
也就是空气变量的当前值。

00:26:42.980 --> 00:26:45.860
That is what I want the size of the balloon to be.
这就是我希望气球达到的大小。

00:26:45.860 --> 00:26:47.990
I press the flag to start the program.
我点击旗帜来启动程序。

00:26:47.990 --> 00:26:50.330
And so now this balloon is constantly going
现在这个气球会不断地

00:26:50.330 --> 00:26:53.150
to be checking what is the value of the air variable.
检查空气变量的值是多少。

00:26:53.150 --> 00:26:55.570
And depending upon the value of the air variable,
根据空气变量的值，

00:26:55.570 --> 00:26:57.320
that's how big the balloon is going to be.
气球就会呈现相应的大小。

00:26:57.320 --> 00:27:00.170
So I can now just drag along the slider.
现在我可以拖动滑块了。

00:27:00.170 --> 00:27:03.680
And as I drag along the slider, you'll see the balloon grow and shrink.
当我拖动滑块时，你会看到气球变大变小。

00:27:03.680 --> 00:27:06.170
I'm changing the value of the air variable,
我在改变空气变量的值，

00:27:06.170 --> 00:27:10.010
and constantly forever the balloon is updating its size
气球会一直不断地更新自身大小，

00:27:10.010 --> 00:27:13.700
to be whatever the value of that variable should be.
以匹配该变量的当前值。

00:27:13.700 --> 00:27:17.450
And so variables don't just have to be set by these like set variable to,
所以变量不只是能通过“将变量设为”

00:27:17.450 --> 00:27:19.790
or change variable by values.
或者“将变量改变多少”这样的操作来设置。

00:27:19.790 --> 00:27:22.790
You can also just let the user control a variable directly
你也可以让用户直接控制变量，

00:27:22.790 --> 00:27:25.410
to let them interact with your Scratch project.
让他们与你的Scratch项目进行交互。

00:27:25.410 --> 00:27:30.110
Let them decide how things should behave or what a particular sprite should
让他们决定事物应该如何表现，或者某个特定角色应该

00:27:30.110 --> 00:27:32.760
look like for example.
是什么样子，举个例子。

00:27:32.760 --> 00:27:35.090
And let's do one final example with variables.
我们再用变量做一个最后的例子。

00:27:35.090 --> 00:27:39.050
This time taking advantage of the Pen tool to draw some shapes.
这次利用画笔工具来绘制一些形状。

00:27:39.050 --> 00:27:41.210
And so I'll bring back the cat.
那我把小猫角色再调出来。

00:27:44.540 --> 00:27:46.100
Here's our cat again.
我们的小猫又回来了。

00:27:46.100 --> 00:27:50.120
And you might recall from before that we could get the cat to move in a circle
你可能还记得，之前我们可以让小猫画圈移动，

00:27:50.120 --> 00:27:55.170
by doing something like when the green flag is clicked, then
方法是，比如当点击绿色旗帜时，然后

00:27:55.170 --> 00:28:01.350
forever have the cat move a certain number of steps
让小猫永远向前移动一定的步数，

00:28:01.350 --> 00:28:04.030
and then turn a certain number of degrees.
然后转动一定的角度。

00:28:04.030 --> 00:28:06.630
And that had the effect of moving the cat in a circle
这样做的效果是让猫绕着圈移动

00:28:06.630 --> 00:28:11.810
over and over just by moving, and then turning a little bit every time.
只是通过移动，然后每次转动一点点，就能反复这样。

00:28:11.810 --> 00:28:15.770
And if we wanted to draw that, we could use the Pen tool to try and draw that.
如果我们想把它画出来，我们可以用画笔工具来试着画一画。

00:28:15.770 --> 00:28:18.580
I'll have the Scratch cat start in a particular place
我会让Scratch猫在一个特定的位置开始

00:28:18.580 --> 00:28:19.960
when the green flag is clicked.
当绿色旗帜被点击时。

00:28:19.960 --> 00:28:22.210
Let's go ahead and go to 0, 0.
我们直接让它移动到坐标(0, 0)。

00:28:22.210 --> 00:28:25.405
And be sure you're pointing 90 degrees-- meaning to the right.
并且确保它指向90度方向——也就是向右。

00:28:25.405 --> 00:28:28.030
And that's going to start the Scratch cut off in the same place
这样每次Scratch猫都会从同一个位置开始

00:28:28.030 --> 00:28:32.060
every time so we get a consistent circle.
这样我们就能得到一个大小一致的圆圈。

00:28:32.060 --> 00:28:35.900
But what I can do is add the pen extension, which we've seen before,
但我可以做的是添加画笔扩展，我们之前见过这个，

00:28:35.900 --> 00:28:38.140
to do a little bit of drawing.
来进行一些绘制。

00:28:38.140 --> 00:28:41.250
We're going to erase everything.
我们要把所有东西都擦除。

00:28:41.250 --> 00:28:47.360
And then put the pen down to let the cat start drawing.
然后放下画笔，让猫开始画画。

00:28:47.360 --> 00:28:50.730
And now what you're noticing is the cat's moving in a circle.
现在你会注意到猫正在绕着圈移动。

00:28:50.730 --> 00:28:53.120
And as it moves in that circle, it's drawing.
当它绕着圈移动时，它也在绘制。

00:28:53.120 --> 00:28:56.680
It's using the pen to draw the circle that it's moving in.
它用画笔绘制它正在移动的圆圈。

00:28:56.680 --> 00:28:59.210
And if I want to make the cat move a little bit more slowly,
如果我想让猫移动得慢一点，

00:28:59.210 --> 00:29:01.040
I might have the cat wait a little bit.
我可以让猫等待一会儿。

00:29:01.040 --> 00:29:02.998
Let's just have it wait a fraction of a second.
就让它等待零点几秒吧。

00:29:02.998 --> 00:29:04.940
Maybe 0.05 seconds.
也许0.05秒。

00:29:04.940 --> 00:29:07.880
And now the cat's moving a little more slowly.
现在猫移动得更慢了。

00:29:07.880 --> 00:29:13.073
And you can actually see it drawing that circle just by drawing it like that.
实际上你可以看到它这样绘制出那个圆圈。

00:29:13.073 --> 00:29:14.990
But we're not really using any variables here.
但我们在这里实际上没有用到任何变量。

00:29:14.990 --> 00:29:17.690
The reason why variables can be helpful is because we
变量之所以有用，是因为我们

00:29:17.690 --> 00:29:19.520
can change the cat's behavior.
可以改变猫的行为。

00:29:19.520 --> 00:29:22.460
Maybe not have it move by 10 steps every time.
也许不让它每次都移动10步。

00:29:22.460 --> 00:29:26.120
But have it move by a different number of steps every time.
而是让它每次移动不同的步数。

00:29:26.120 --> 00:29:28.200
So I'll create a new variable.
所以我要创建一个新变量。

00:29:28.200 --> 00:29:30.420
I'll call it steps.
我把它叫做“步数”。

00:29:30.420 --> 00:29:35.310
And we'll start by setting steps equal to 0.
我们先把“步数”的值设为0。

00:29:35.310 --> 00:29:39.880
And instead of moving 10 steps, let's move steps steps.
不要移动10步了，让它移动“步数”那么多步。

00:29:39.880 --> 00:29:43.560
Whatever the value of that variable is, that's how far I would like to move.
无论这个变量的值是多少，我就想移动那么远。

00:29:43.560 --> 00:29:47.400
But then every time you move, we're going to change the number of steps
但每次移动后，我们要改变“步数”的数值

00:29:47.400 --> 00:29:50.190
by something like 0.5.
比如改变0.5。

00:29:50.190 --> 00:29:53.740
A small number just to make a very small change.
一个小数字，这样只会产生很小的变化。

00:29:53.740 --> 00:29:56.190
So what's going on now with all of these blocks?
那么现在这些积木块都在做什么呢？

00:29:56.190 --> 00:29:57.390
We'll try and recap.
我们来总结一下。

00:29:57.390 --> 00:29:59.753
At the very beginning, when we first start the program,
在最开始，当我们刚启动程序时，

00:29:59.753 --> 00:30:01.170
we're doing a little bit of setup.
我们做了一些初始化设置。

00:30:01.170 --> 00:30:03.210
We're saying have the cat go back to 0, 0.
我们让猫回到坐标(0, 0)。

00:30:03.210 --> 00:30:04.920
Just to the center of the stage.
移到舞台正中央。

00:30:04.920 --> 00:30:06.300
Have it point in 90 degrees.
让它指向90度方向。

00:30:06.300 --> 00:30:07.620
Meaning point to the right.
也就是指向右边。

00:30:07.620 --> 00:30:09.125
And erase everything.
然后清除所有内容。

00:30:09.125 --> 00:30:11.250
So if there were already things drawn on the stage,
所以如果舞台上已经画了东西，

00:30:11.250 --> 00:30:13.650
just erase them so that we can start fresh.
就把它们清除掉，这样我们就可以重新开始。

00:30:13.650 --> 00:30:15.690
And now put the pen down.
现在把画笔放下。

00:30:15.690 --> 00:30:18.960
Meaning wherever the Scratch cat moves, the pen is going to follow.
这意味着无论Scratch猫移到哪里，画笔都会跟着移动。

00:30:18.960 --> 00:30:21.210
And it's going to trace those shapes.
并且会描绘出那些形状。

00:30:21.210 --> 00:30:24.030
And we have a variable keeping track of how far
我们有一个变量来记录每次

00:30:24.030 --> 00:30:26.790
the cat's going to move every time.
猫要移动多远。

00:30:26.790 --> 00:30:28.470
Right now, it's starts at 0.
现在，它从0开始。

00:30:28.470 --> 00:30:30.120
So we move that number of steps.
所以我们移动相应步数。

00:30:30.120 --> 00:30:33.420
But over time, we're going to increase the number of steps the cats moving.
但随着时间推移，我们会增加猫移动的步数。

00:30:33.420 --> 00:30:36.220
Increase it by a little bit, and then rotate.
稍微增加一点步数，然后旋转。

00:30:36.220 --> 00:30:39.702
And if we keep increasing how much the cat's moving and then rotating,
如果我们不断增加猫移动的距离，然后旋转，

00:30:39.702 --> 00:30:41.910
what you're going to see is a more interesting shape.
你会看到一个更有趣的形状。

00:30:41.910 --> 00:30:44.730
It's not going to draw a perfect circle.
它不会画出一个完美的圆。

00:30:44.730 --> 00:30:49.485
But it's instead going to draw something like this spiral.
而是会画出像这样的螺旋线。

00:30:49.485 --> 00:30:52.410
Notice it's moving by more and more every time.
注意它每次移动的距离越来越远。

00:30:52.410 --> 00:30:54.750
And as it moves more and more with the pen down,
当它带着放下的画笔移动得越来越远时，

00:30:54.750 --> 00:30:58.380
we're able to see this interesting spiral result from it.
我们就能看到这样有趣的螺旋线效果。

00:30:58.380 --> 00:31:01.050
Because it started by moving very little every single time.
因为一开始它每次只移动很小的距离。

00:31:01.050 --> 00:31:02.910
Just moving by a few steps.
只移动几步。

00:31:02.910 --> 00:31:06.300
And over time it's moving more, and more, and more every time it rotates.
随着时间推移，每次旋转时它移动得越来越远。

00:31:06.300 --> 00:31:09.932
And that's creating the shape that you're able to see here.
这就形成了你在这里看到的形状。

00:31:09.932 --> 00:31:12.390
And so by taking advantage of the pen, and taking advantage
所以，利用画笔，以及

00:31:12.390 --> 00:31:14.580
of variables and loops, you're able to create
变量和循环，你就能创造出

00:31:14.580 --> 00:31:16.200
some really interesting works of art.
一些非常有趣的艺术作品。

00:31:16.200 --> 00:31:19.530
Shapes that can be drawn just by sprites on the stage
仅通过舞台上的角色就能画出的形状

00:31:19.530 --> 00:31:22.020
by calculating, by modifying some variables
通过计算、修改一些变量，

00:31:22.020 --> 00:31:25.650
and adjusting what those variables should do in order to create
并调整这些变量的作用，就能创造出

00:31:25.650 --> 00:31:27.880
more and more interesting programs.
越来越有趣的程序。

00:31:27.880 --> 00:31:30.330
And you can see up here in the upper left
你可以在左上角看到

00:31:30.330 --> 00:31:34.350
this keeping track of how many steps it is that we've
这里记录了我们在这个程序中

00:31:34.350 --> 00:31:37.750
taken so far inside of this program.
到目前为止移动的步数。

00:31:37.750 --> 00:31:40.380
So variables add a lot of power to the programs
所以变量为我们在Scratch里创建的程序增添了强大的功能。

00:31:40.380 --> 00:31:42.330
that we can create inside of Scratch.
它们让我们能够创建更复杂的程序。

00:31:42.330 --> 00:31:45.480
They give us the ability to keep track of whatever information we want.
它们让我们能够记录任何我们想要的信息。

00:31:45.480 --> 00:31:48.870
And then to use that information later on in our programs
然后在程序中后续使用这些信息。

00:31:48.870 --> 00:31:52.830
to create even more exciting games, and animations, and stories
去创造更精彩的游戏、动画和故事

00:31:52.830 --> 00:31:55.590
all just through the use of the Scratch box.
这一切都只需通过使用Scratch软件来实现。

00:31:55.590 --> 00:31:58.660
That's it for an Introduction to Programming with Scratch for today.
今天的《用Scratch学编程入门》就到这里。

00:31:58.660 --> 00:32:00.680
We'll see you next time.
我们下次再见。
